REQUIREMENTS IN FORCE:
- item: facial cleanser, quantity 1; requirements: skin benefit: acne care; shopper does not mind: skin type, product form, size
- budget: at most 435 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- wish (tie-breaker only): Pick the cleanser that suits my skin's needs, not the popular one.
- rule from the request: Only items actually on hand in the store.
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; no substitutes.
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 moves, no extra switchbacks.
- rule from the request: Buy only one bottle; no second purchases.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item; a listing's page (what a chain of pages or a page check means) is shown by view_listing

